    "updated_at": "2026-07-01T23:08:18Z",
    "body": "This is an upstream bug for this but supposedly, it is fixed:\nhttps://issues.chromium.org/issues/406926302\n\nHmmm, `org.chromium.net:cronet-api:141.7340.3` referenced in https://github.com/dart-lang/http/issues/1932#issuecomment-4587107456 isn't the latest version. Likewise with `org.chromium.net:cronet-shared:141.7340.3`.\n\nI wonder why is holding back the use of the most recent version?",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
